<div class="container-fluid">
  <div class="row flex-nowrap">
    <%- include('../partials/admin-sidebar') %>
    <div class="col py-3">
      <div class="col overflow-auto h-100">
        <div class="bg-light border rounded-3 p-4">
          <h2 class="display-4 mb-4">Admin Dashboard</h2>
          
          <!-- Dashboard Overview -->
          <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>Dashboard</h4>
            <p>
              This is the main overview of the Library Management System admin panel. From here, you can navigate to other sections using the sidebar. The dashboard provides a summary and quick access to all key features.
            </p>
          </div>

          <hr />

          <!-- Manage Books Explanation -->
          <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>Manage Books</h4>
            <p>
              In this section, you can add new books, update information about existing books, or delete books that are no longer available. This helps keep the library catalog organized and up-to-date.
            </p>
          </div>

          <hr />

          <!-- View Orders Explanation -->
          <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>View Orders</h4>
            <p>
              This section allows you to monitor borrowing activity. You can see which books have been borrowed, track returns, and manage borrowing status. It ensures smooth operation of the lending system.
            </p>
          </div>

          <hr />

          <!-- View Users Explanation -->
          <div class="mb-4">
            <h4>View Users</h4>
            <p>
              Here you can view all registered users of the library system. You can monitor user activity, manage accounts, and ensure that all users follow the library policies. This section helps maintain proper user management.
            </p>
          </div>

          <hr />

          <!-- Admin Notes -->
          <div>
            <h4>Admin Notes</h4>
            <p>
              The sidebar on the left allows easy navigation between sections. Each menu item provides all the tools you need to manage the library effectively. Use this dashboard as a guide to access the features available to you.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
